  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sierra Leone Secondary Education Improvement Programme Phase II (SSEIP 2) CDEL Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSEIP2 will improve access to quality education, learning, safety and health outcomes for 1.6 million children (including 800,000 adolescent girls and children with disabilities.  It will directly contribute to: (i) 160,000 more girls in school, (ii) a doubling in enrolment of Children with disabilities (iii) 50,000 more girls passing end of secondary school examinations and (iv) a reduction in adolescent childbearing.</narrative>
  </description>
